"The Netherlands has the tallest people on Earth (average 6'). Good nutrition, healthcare, and environment help you reach your potential."
"In the UAE, 90% of the population are expatriates. You're not alone in starting over — you're part of a global community."
"Canada has two official languages and makes it work. Communication barriers are challenges, not dead ends."
"In Switzerland, military service includes keeping your rifle at home. Trust is built through responsibility and accountability."
