"In Denmark, 67% of people use bikes daily even in winter. Consistency beats convenience when building lasting habits."
"Switzerland has 208 mountains above 3,000 meters. Challenges surround you — climb them one at a time."
"Japan has 'forest bathing' (shinrin-yoku) — prescribed by doctors for stress relief. Nature heals — schedule time for it."
