"In the Netherlands, people say 'Doe maar gewoon' — just be normal. Authentic simplicity beats pretentious complexity."
"Singapore has one of the lowest crime rates globally despite high density. Safe societies are built on shared values and accountability."
"In Norway, you can see the Northern Lights from September to March. Beauty exists — sometimes you just need to look up at the right time."
